    {
      "name": "create_pool_atomic",
      "docs": [
        "Atomically create a pool and initialize all DRT mints/vaults/supply in one instruction.",
        "",
        "Remaining accounts must be provided in strict interleaved order:",
        "`[mint_0, vault_0, extra_metas_0, mint_1, vault_1, extra_metas_1, ...]`",
        "",
        "For hook-enabled mints, `extra_metas` is the ExtraAccountMetaList PDA",
        "(`[\"extra-account-metas\", mint]` under this program). For non-hook mints,",
        "the slot is unused and may be any valid account.",
        "",
        "**Compute budget**: The default 200,000 CU limit may be insufficient for",
        "pools near `MAX_DRT_CONFIGS = 20`, especially with TransferHook and",
        "TransferFeeConfig extensions. Callers should include a",
        "`ComputeBudgetInstruction::set_compute_unit_limit` instruction for large pools."
      ],
